:: Zay English Poet Rap [nobr]

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> decides that the class should spend the hour reading one of Shakespeare’s classics quietly to themselves so that he can nurse a headache with a nap. This leads to an easy, though extremely boring, class. As the teacher naps away, you lay back at your desk, feeling the boredom sinking in as you spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> seemingly also getting restless from reading the poems. <br>

